The moment Chen Ji broke through, the seal on the third page of the Tianji Record shattered completely. A torrent of information flooded his Mental Sea like a flood—heavy and overwhelming. It was the cultivation technique condensed from Chen Xuan's lifetime of painstaking effort: Tianji Nine Transformations!

First Transformation Divine Mechanism: allows窥探探查一炷香内万事万物的运行轨迹;
Second Transformation Heavenly Eye: can see through all illusions and disguises,直达本质;
Third Transformation Reverse Fate: can reverse one certain death at a critical moment, but each use doubles the Heavenly Fate consumption.

At the same time, Mo Xiansheng's relieved voice echoed in his Mental Sea:
